# Who else is in the room? Van Eyck's Arnolfini Portrait
tags: ["renaissance art","van eyck","mirror symbolism","flemish painting","perspective","witness"]
teaches: ["art-history/reading-paintings","concepts/perspective-and-reflection","vocabulary/renaissance-techniques","methods/visual-analysis"]
